## User Stories / Screens

### Screen 1: Dashboard
- Summary cards: (total jobs, active runs, failures, etc.)
- Recent activity feed
- Key metric chart
- Quick action buttons (New Connection, New Job, etc.)

### Screen 2: {Primary Entity} List
- Table with pagination, search, filters
- Status badges
- Bulk actions (delete)
- "Add new" modal/form

### Screen 3: {Primary Entity} Detail
- Info card with edit/delete
- Related entities (tabs or sections)
- Action buttons (Run, Pause, etc.)
- Activity/log timeline

### Screen 4: {Secondary Entity} List or Wizard
- (Add more screens as the domain requires)

### Screen 5: AI Copilot Panel (REQUIRED — see §9 REVISED-PRD.md)
- Global floating sidebar/drawer accessible from every page
- Chat interface with domain-aware context (knows active entity, connection types, schema)
- Suggests next actions, not just answers
- Falls back to local Ollama when cloud LLM unavailable

