## AI Features

Every DClaw app MUST include an AI Copilot as its first P0 feature (per `REVISED-PRD.md` §9).

| Feature | Description | Endpoint |
|---------|-------------|----------|
| **AI Copilot** | Domain-aware chat. Suggests next actions. | `POST /api/v1/ai/chat` |
| **{AI Feature 2}** | (e.g., risk assessment, anomaly detection) | `POST /api/v1/ai/{action}` |
| **{AI Feature 3}** | (e.g., auto-mapping, classification) | `POST /api/v1/ai/{action}` |

